{"schema":"1.0","details":{"displayName":"v1.0.12_578EHRMTrainingApp_SendEmailReminders","description":"The \"Send Email Reminder\" flow emails a **\"You are scheduled for EHRM Learning Lab training!\"** confirmation/reminder to users who have been scheduled for an EHRM Learning Lab training session.\n\nIt reads the scheduled user's details from the `DeskAccessControl` SharePoint list — display name, user principal (email), access level/role, the scheduling admin (`Author`), and the access window (`AccessStop_dateTime`) — and formats them into an Adaptive Card email body so the recipient can review prerequisites and event information.","createdTime":"2026-08-21T12:40:12.1769035Z","packageTelemetryId":"0f685147-8711-4098-99f3-7142f615303c","creator":"N/A","sourceEnvironment":"U.S. Department of Veterans Affairs (default)"},"resources":{"ecd1d899-5df4-4795-a98b-f1a1b55ee837":{"type":"Microsoft.Flow/flows","suggestedCreationType":"New","creationType":"Existing, New, Update","details":{"displayName":"578EHRMTrainingApp_SendEmailReminder"},"configurableBy":"User","hierarchy":"Root","dependsOn":["b7a19980-d1d5-4e59-958e-7a830009aab3","0f6b0251-8561-4244-9908-896231504893","265925bf-b22c-4735-941e-ccd305926167","4fa05f00-8186-4c6f-8122-4541fff128df","f2da7bcf-890c-4539-ac3e-2e1d977ffa87","120f76dd-d49e-4703-969f-8bee43bf1de8"]},"b7a19980-d1d5-4e59-958e-7a830009aab3":{"id":"/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_sharepointonline","name":"shared_sharepointonline","type":"Microsoft.PowerApps/apis","suggestedCreationType":"Existing","details":{"displayName":"SharePoint","iconUri":"https://gov.static.powerapps.us/resource/ppcr/releases/v1.0.1769/1.0.1769.4361/sharepointonline/icon.png"},"configurableBy":"System","hierarchy":"Child","dependsOn":[]},"0f6b0251-8561-4244-9908-896231504893":{"type":"Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/connections","suggestedCreationType":"Existing","creationType":"Existing","details":{"displayName":"Kyle.Coder@va.gov","iconUri":"https://gov.static.powerapp